<title>UK: Rabobank sets C$100 million bond.</title>
<headline>Rabobank sets C$100 million bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager joint lead managers Wood Gundy and Rabobank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RABOBANK</p>
<p> AMT    C$100 MLN     COUPON     6.0	 MATURITY    31.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.585   PAY DATE    10.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.985    SPREAD	+25 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    AMST	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/CA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.275     SELL CONC  1.60	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
</text>
